{"parse": {"title": "TWJ-08", "pageid": 40885, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TWJ-07\" title=\"TWJ-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TWJ-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TWJ</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.B0.E8.81.8C.E6.8A.A5.E5.91.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"述职报告\">述职报告</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 述职报告</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Debriefing</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>情<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>埃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>定<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191008</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shikunei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shikunei\"><img alt=\"shikunei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/600px-Cg-shikunei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/900px-Cg-shikunei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/1200px-Cg-shikunei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久后，枪声引来了另一阵脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-618212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-618212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-618212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>是你们吗！红弩箭！阿历克塞！哈桑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洞穴里传来贝托尔特的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-507510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-507510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-507510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>贝托尔特——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren\"><img alt=\"1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png/600px-Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png/900px-Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_at_ys_dongzhongdezhongren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我回答了贝托尔特。跟着声音，他找到了我们在的房间，比我们要顺畅许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>见到倒在阿历克塞身边的哈桑，他很惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-618201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我们会记得哈桑的英勇牺牲，他死于和敌人的战斗，是个好汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>阿历克塞没有接受贝托尔特的这个说法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-507512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>他是个诚实的人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shikunei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shikunei\"><img alt=\"shikunei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/600px-Cg-shikunei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/900px-Cg-shikunei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Cg-shikunei.png/1200px-Cg-shikunei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿历克塞：</div><div>不，长官，是我杀死了一位同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭从哈桑的尸体下抽出一叠蒙着灰与血的东西，扔给贝托尔特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厚厚的文档落在军靴边，落地扑起一点儿转身即去的尘烟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>恭喜你，长官，任务圆满完成。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你进去得比我早，居然会出来得比我晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>他们不放我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>那看来你聊得还挺愉快。我就很讨厌被人问话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我很诚实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>和阿历克塞一样诚实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>结束了，别忘了你的述职报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>回你该回的地方去吧，你的战场旅行结束了，恭喜你，隼崽儿，你没死在乌哈拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭没说什么，只是回头望了望那间审讯室。大门已经关上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>感觉如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>和想象中不太一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>当然，当然，对那些从未亲历战事的人来说嘛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>战争就像田园牧歌一样浪漫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>挺身而出，然后死于枪口小小的嘲弄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>变成统计簿上的一个分子，一个小小的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哈桑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>别担心，芝诺会给他妻子提供生活保障。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这“划算”吗，贝托尔特长官？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他是个快活的人。不能说我们共事的这段日子没有产生友谊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>现实点讲，哈桑也是很好的宣传材料。他是一个典范。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>功利，理性，现实，利益导向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>为芝诺做事，立下功勋，你的家人也会得到优待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他们最重视家族和血缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>一举两得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>还是去看看阿历克塞吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人走到阿历克塞所在的审讯室外，隔着窗户，看向屋里那个沉默的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他注意到了窗外的人，抬头，停下签字的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>他看见我们了。阿历克塞在笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我一早就跟你说了，这事不怎么严重，是他自己非要去提这个报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你见过谁会主动跑来说“长官，我刚枪毙了一个自己的弟兄”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我不想把他送上军事法庭，但拦不住他自己往上撞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>……唉，死脑筋的年轻人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>能坚持点什么，挺不容易的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他不适合那儿，乌哈拉对他来说是个不合时宜的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>或者说，他对乌哈拉来讲，有些不合时宜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>啧，文字游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>别担心阿历克塞，上将会喜欢他这样的年轻人的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>这个案子会出现在将军的办公桌上，我保证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>至于你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>明天早上会有一趟飞机，你留在房间的行李已经收拾好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这么客气？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>因为你要带着这里的故事回到军备学院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你会和放着黑色郁金香的棺材一起走下飞机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你会告诉你那些小屁孩同学——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>终有一天，也许我们每个人的归宿都是这副黑漆漆的金属盒子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-507511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-507511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-507511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>前线还需要我，但愿我们还有机会见面，小同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>也祝你好运，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>对了，差点忘了。有东西要给你，是阿历克塞来之前托给我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这个，哈桑的遗物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>ZENO<br />A-150756</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官将名牌拿在手心，端详一阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我不记得为他做过这个……“ZENO”，协从军的名牌上不会刻这几个字母。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>阿历克塞跟我说，这是上个月他和哈桑私底下偷偷去找人刻的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哈桑生前一直很希望自己能真正成为芝诺的一份子，他很喜欢这个“大家庭”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝托尔特低下头，若有所思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他会得到一枚真的……我会为他在总部的纪功廊上争取一个名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个几乎写满了牺牲者的庄严而荣耀的漆黑长廊——无论那些名字死于战火，还是没于“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他会像一个真正的芝诺士兵那样，带着刻有自己名字的名牌，长眠在芝诺公墓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官转身离开，将小士兵转交给他的遗物紧紧攥在手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长廊中回荡着军靴踢踏的响声。红弩箭留在原地，最后一次看向审讯室里如释重负般的昔日战友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿历克塞在等待他的结局，而芝诺在等待他。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TWJ-08"}}